* ============================================================
*  PINOCCHIO BUILD DIMS -- CLASSES + MAJORS (Phase 3c, AIF-167)
*
*  Status:  CANDIDATE / REVIEW_BEFORE_EXECUTION. Creates NEW tables only;
*           the fact fixtures (STUDENTS, ENROLL) are never opened, so this
*           is safe to run even while a read-only battery holds them.
*  Path:    same mature recipe as pinocchio_build.dts -- CREATE X64 +
*           IMPORT + CDX + BUILDLMDB. SID-style N-typing lesson honored
*           (CNUM is N(3); no bare I types).
*  Input:   tmp/pinocchio/classes.csv + majors.csv, written by
*           dottalkpp/scripts/pinocchio/gen_pinocchio_dims.ps1 (an
*           ENUMERATION of the fact generator's closed CLS_ID universe --
*           FK integrity holds by construction, no fixture scan needed).
*  CLS_ID:  C(12) to MATCH ENROLL.CLS_ID exactly -- same-family typed
*           columns are what the join and IN paths require.
* ============================================================
SET ECHO OFF
SET TIMER ON

SET PATH DBF DBF/pinocchio
SET PATH INDEXES INDEXES/pinocchio
SET PATH LMDB LMDB/pinocchio

* Startup cleanup: drop dims left by an earlier run (harmless "not found").
CLOSE
ERASE TABLE CLASSES CONFIRM
ERASE TABLE MAJORS CONFIRM

ECHO === CLASSES: create x64 structure, IMPORT 9900 rows, index CLS_ID + MAJOR ===
CREATE X64 CLASSES (CLS_ID C(12), TERM C(3), MAJOR C(4), CNUM N(3))
IMPORT tmp/pinocchio/classes.csv
SHOW COLUMNS
ECHO --- COUNT must be exactly 9900 ---
COUNT
CDX CREATE
CDX ADDTAG CLS_ID
CDX ADDTAG MAJOR
BUILDLMDB SMALL CLEAN YES
CDX TAGS
ECHO --- tag-sanity gate (first-run lesson): COUNT under TAG CLS_ID must be 9900 ---
SET ORDER TO TAG CLS_ID
COUNT
SET ORDER TO PHYSICAL

ECHO === MAJORS: create x64 structure, IMPORT 11 rows, index MAJOR ===
CREATE X64 MAJORS (MAJOR C(4), MNAME C(24))
IMPORT tmp/pinocchio/majors.csv
SHOW COLUMNS
ECHO --- COUNT must be exactly 11 ---
COUNT
CDX CREATE
CDX ADDTAG MAJOR
BUILDLMDB TINY CLEAN YES
CDX TAGS

ECHO ============================================================
ECHO DIMS BUILD COMPLETE. A zero exit code is NOT proof -- confirm:
ECHO   - CLASSES COUNT = 9900 physical AND 9900 under TAG CLS_ID
ECHO   - MAJORS COUNT = 11
ECHO   - every BUILDLMDB reported OK
ECHO Next: run_pinocchio_star_teed.ps1 (Phase 3c star battery)
ECHO ============================================================
